Installing the USB driver
  copied C:\WINNT351\System32\drivers\usbnt.sys
  copied C:\WINNT351\System32\usbeject.exe
  copied C:\WINNT351\System32\usbtree.exe
  copied C:\WINNT351\System32\usbmon.exe
  copied C:\WINNT351\System32\usbcam.exe
  copied C:\WINNT351\System32\usbinst.exe
  copied C:\WINNT351\System32\usbntcap.dll
  usbntcap.dll registered as Video for Windows driver msvideo (cameras)
  service usbnt registered (boot start, group SCSI miniport)
  i8042prt disabled, usbnt drives the PS/2 keyboard and mouse
  kbdclass and mouclass set to serve USB and PS/2 together
Done. Restart Windows NT to load the driver.
